{"candidateAnswer":"Reward-based training methods","evidence":"[D6:4 | 2:03 pm on 11 May, 2023] Audrey: I know right? I saw this workshop flyer at my local pet store. It was a positive reinforcement training class and I wanted to give it a shot. The volunteer in the store was nice enough to let me meet their dog – he was so friendly and playful!\n[D26:5 | 2:36 pm on 28 October, 2023] Audrey: The behaviorist gave me tips on how to handle it and suggested some changes in their routine. I'm using positive reinforcement techniques and it's still a work in progress, but I'm hopeful it'll help.","itemId":"urn:uuid:7899d661-a51a-5ce9-9dc9-ccbac458ab3b","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:200444988405909574c62c5ff169aa977e183d882cd36328a2d723a8904a7496","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What technique is Audrey using to discipline her dogs?","referenceAnswer":"Positive reinforcement","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"200444988405909574c62c5ff169aa977e183d882cd36328a2d723a8904a7496"}}]}